WEBVTT

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.642
THE FAMILIAR OF ZERO VOL.14

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:21.021
Look what we have here.

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:26.025
Takafumi brought a naughty book to school!

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.110
It's not naughty.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:28.278
Let me see it!

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:31.364
-Stop it!
-Naughty, naughty!

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:34.117
Oh, no. Kacchan is picking on Takafumi.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.618
He's done for.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.913
All the illustrations are of women.

00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:40.331
I knew it was dirty.

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.708
-It's dirty.
-No, it's not.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.877
-How naughty.
-It's just a fantasy light novel.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:46.254
"It's just a 'panda-sy tight' novel."

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.716
That was spot-on!

00:00:52.302 --> 00:00:55.346
Give me the naughty book.

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.514
Ms. Fujimiya.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:59.601
THE FAMILIAR OF ZERO VOL.14
AQUILEIA'S SAINT

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:00.977
BY NOBORU YAMAGUCHI

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.022
You call this explicit?

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:07.108
You aren't a toddler anymore.

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.903
-Run!
-Kacchan is finished.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.864
I'm sorry, Ms. Fujimiya.

00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.075
I'm sorry, Ms. Fujimiya.

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:21.039
Fujimiya, you are so impressive.

00:01:21.122 --> 00:01:24.167
Right? That's my Fujimiya.

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:26.920
You scared Kacchan to death.

00:02:09.045 --> 00:02:11.214
UNCLE:
YOU'RE FINE THE WAY YOU ARE

00:02:42.453 --> 00:02:44.122
GET HOME

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:50.378
SOLD CHEAPER THAN A SCOURING PAD

00:02:57.969 --> 00:02:59.429
<i>That may be true.</i>

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:02.682
I might have been quite a brat
for the first few years of grade school.

00:03:03.266 --> 00:03:06.144
But I became more girlie
by the time I hit middle school.

00:03:08.271 --> 00:03:09.439
See?

00:03:14.235 --> 00:03:15.653
Wow!

00:03:16.487 --> 00:03:19.073
A picture of you and Takafumi.

00:03:19.157 --> 00:03:22.118
-Let me take a picture of this.
-A picture?

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:23.578
FUNCTION - PLAY - DISPLAY - ZOOM

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:30.084
If you want, I can send it to your phone.

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:33.630
-How?
-I can email it or something.

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:37.091
This phone doesn't have an in-box,
and it can't call.

00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:38.551
What?

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:43.014
How do you communicate with Takafumi
without a working cell phone?

00:03:43.514 --> 00:03:48.228
I'm wondering if we can use
smoke signals or flags.

00:03:48.311 --> 00:03:51.356
Smoke is prohibited
in an apartment building.

00:03:51.856 --> 00:03:53.399
Smoke signals and flags…

00:03:53.983 --> 00:03:56.903
<i>I didn't realize that this apartment</i>
<i>was a medieval castle.</i>

00:03:59.697 --> 00:04:00.907
-What?
-What?

00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:03.368
Why is this coffee ridiculously delicious?

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.328
Can you tell?

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:10.458
I got 10,000 yen for my 20th birthday, so
I bought a coffee mill and a bag of beans.

00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:15.171
It's my first time tasting coffee brewed
from freshly-ground beans. So distinct.

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:18.383
Uncle gave you 10,000 yen in cash
as your birthday gift?

00:04:18.466 --> 00:04:19.509
How practical.

00:04:20.134 --> 00:04:21.386
I had to.

00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:26.808
I have no clue
what youngsters want nowadays.

00:04:29.185 --> 00:04:32.188
Well, any gift is welcome
if you put your heart into it.

00:04:32.772 --> 00:04:33.648
Really?

00:04:33.731 --> 00:04:37.610
What if I got a GAME GEAR TV tuner?

00:04:38.278 --> 00:04:39.612
That's not a good gift.

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:41.698
CAN'T WATCH A THING
(ANALOG BROADCAST ENDED IN 2011)

00:04:41.781 --> 00:04:43.074
Seriously, I appreciate cash.

00:04:43.157 --> 00:04:46.536
As there is still some money left,
I'll get more beans.

00:04:46.619 --> 00:04:49.289
I'll get some sweets then.

00:04:50.164 --> 00:04:53.293
<i>Birthday gift, huh?</i>

00:04:56.838 --> 00:04:57.714
NEW MESSAGE

00:05:07.765 --> 00:05:08.933
A GIFT

00:05:09.017 --> 00:05:10.351
FROM MY MIDDLE SCHOOL DAYS

00:05:16.607 --> 00:05:18.276
<i>How can I help you?</i>

00:05:18.359 --> 00:05:20.528
How to delete pictures on social media.

00:05:20.611 --> 00:05:22.322
Wait, why are you deleting it?

00:05:22.405 --> 00:05:25.241
-<i>This is what I found online…</i>
-Seriously, it's risky.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:27.910
-<i>…about deleting photos on social media.</i>
-What's risky about it?

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:30.580
You could get arrested
and become ostracized by society.

00:05:32.248 --> 00:05:35.376
You can get arrested for this?
How frightening!

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:36.669
You can't.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.380
Actually, I'm not sure.

00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:41.466
Sorry, perhaps I was being hasty.

00:05:41.549 --> 00:05:43.634
Also, please don't show it to your uncle.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.511
THIS MONTH'S DEAL
ETHIOPIAN COFFEE BEANS

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:49.390
Coffee beans are on sale today.
I'm gonna go get a bag!

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:50.475
What?

00:06:04.906 --> 00:06:06.115
Fujimiya.

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:09.327
Your swimsuit photo
that you bet your life on…

00:06:12.163 --> 00:06:16.542
lost to the sales ad for coffee beans
in terms of content appeal.

00:06:19.587 --> 00:06:21.839
No, no, no.

00:06:21.923 --> 00:06:25.218
I was just a middle schooler.

00:06:25.301 --> 00:06:27.095
If he were to see me now--

00:06:33.267 --> 00:06:34.602
Freeze!

00:06:41.359 --> 00:06:43.236
W-- What did you do?

00:06:43.319 --> 00:06:45.696
I spilled my coffee! Did you get burned?

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:48.116
I can't use any healing spells.

00:06:48.699 --> 00:06:51.035
I feel like I'm frostbitten instead.

00:06:51.536 --> 00:06:52.537
Then…

00:06:53.371 --> 00:06:54.914
Spirit of fire,

00:06:54.997 --> 00:06:58.209
turn my enemy into cinder
with scorching hellfire--

00:06:58.292 --> 00:07:00.253
Enough with the magic!

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:09.595
Please, feel free to take a shower.

00:07:16.436 --> 00:07:18.229
<i>I sincerely apologize.</i>

00:07:18.813 --> 00:07:21.899
<i>You might feel uncomfortable</i>
<i>showering while I'm here.</i>

00:07:21.983 --> 00:07:23.943
<i>I'll be out for a couple of hours.</i>

00:07:24.569 --> 00:07:26.904
<i>I'll leave Takafumi's clothes out for you.</i>

00:07:34.328 --> 00:07:35.621
<i>All warm and cozy.</i>

00:07:37.582 --> 00:07:39.542
<i>It's a men's shirt.</i>

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:42.879
<i>What if Takafumi's preference</i>
<i>is girls in boys' shirts?</i>

00:07:42.962 --> 00:07:44.172
<i>Who am I kidding?</i>

00:07:51.095 --> 00:07:55.516
<i>Would he change his mind about me a bit</i>
<i>if he were to see me in the nude?</i>

00:07:56.225 --> 00:07:58.769
-<i>It won't hurt to be seen.</i>
-Uncle?

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.396
Why's the curtain closed?

00:08:17.914 --> 00:08:19.332
S-- Sorry.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:31.344
S-- Seriously, I'm so sorry!

00:08:39.393 --> 00:08:41.604
<i>I'll be out for a couple of hours.</i>

00:09:01.582 --> 00:09:03.042
-Takafumi.
-I'm so sorry.

00:09:04.168 --> 00:09:07.129
I'm trying to shut out that kind of stuff.

00:09:08.047 --> 00:09:10.424
But you are so cute, I can't help myself.

00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:14.845
You must be uncomfortable, being gazed at
in that way by a friend, right?

00:09:18.266 --> 00:09:19.267
Sorry.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.394
If you could look at me in that way,

00:09:21.978 --> 00:09:24.981
actually, I'd be flattered.

00:09:42.248 --> 00:09:43.499
Fujimiya,

00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:46.544
you've been always so thoughtful.

00:09:47.962 --> 00:09:50.590
-I'll take full responsibility.
-Responsibility?

00:09:50.673 --> 00:09:51.841
What do you mean?

00:09:57.346 --> 00:09:59.265
I placed the flag upside down.

00:09:59.348 --> 00:10:00.391
The flag?

00:10:02.476 --> 00:10:03.811
What?

00:10:05.438 --> 00:10:07.064
Takafumi, are you in danger?

00:10:07.148 --> 00:10:09.483
You put the flag in emergency position!

00:10:09.984 --> 00:10:11.068
What is this?

00:10:11.152 --> 00:10:13.571
I used the flag
to signal my uncle to come home.

00:10:14.155 --> 00:10:15.823
<i>The spirits tell him the flag's position.</i>

00:10:15.906 --> 00:10:16.991
DANGER - COME HOME - NORMAL

00:10:17.074 --> 00:10:19.452
These guys were serious about flags
and smoke signals.

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:21.787
Uncle.

00:10:21.871 --> 00:10:25.541
I unintentionally saw
my female friend changing clothes.

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:27.335
I want to be responsible.

00:10:27.418 --> 00:10:29.253
-Could you please erase my memory?
-What!

00:10:30.004 --> 00:10:32.089
I see. Let's wipe it clean.

00:10:32.173 --> 00:10:34.884
Spirit of memory, deliver unto oblivio--

00:10:34.967 --> 00:10:37.219
Stop!

00:10:37.303 --> 00:10:39.972
Why would you do that, you idiot?

00:10:40.056 --> 00:10:42.058
I don't mind it at all!

00:10:42.141 --> 00:10:43.184
Fujimiya.

00:10:44.352 --> 00:10:45.853
-Thank you.
-Stop it!

00:10:45.936 --> 00:10:47.688
You haven't changed a bit.

00:10:47.772 --> 00:10:49.649
You are so thoughtful.

00:10:49.732 --> 00:10:52.443
Stop saying that!
Stop trying to wrap this up!

00:10:52.526 --> 00:10:54.278
-Fujimiya…
-Is this the new coffee bean bag?

00:10:54.362 --> 00:10:56.697
…you are being considerate to me
despite being embarrassed.

00:10:56.781 --> 00:10:57.782
Should I make coffee?

00:10:57.865 --> 00:10:59.992
-I'll do it again if you erase it!
-<i>Fujimiya…</i>

00:11:00.076 --> 00:11:02.745
<i>hasn't changed at all.</i>
<i>She's a wonderful and a caring friend.</i>

00:11:03.287 --> 00:11:05.247
-<i>I'm so happy that we reconnected.</i>
-Dimwit!

00:11:05.998 --> 00:11:09.210
<i>I hope she feels the same as I do.</i>

00:11:10.336 --> 00:11:11.921
LIGHT - DARKNESS - SWORD

00:11:13.964 --> 00:11:15.257
HOROHORO PEACH
3% ALCOHOL

00:11:16.133 --> 00:11:17.885
Hey now.

00:11:18.469 --> 00:11:20.638
Fujimiya, aren't you still underage?

00:11:21.138 --> 00:11:23.140
I turn 20 today so it's perfectly legal.

00:11:23.641 --> 00:11:25.267
Is that so? Happy birthday.

00:11:25.851 --> 00:11:27.228
Thank you so much.

00:11:27.311 --> 00:11:30.898
And you must be 34, as you'd been
in the other world since you were 17.

00:11:31.482 --> 00:11:32.942
Around thirty?

00:11:35.736 --> 00:11:38.989
No, my birthday passed so I'm actually 35.

00:11:39.073 --> 00:11:40.074
I see.

00:11:40.157 --> 00:11:41.450
Around forty then.

00:11:43.202 --> 00:11:46.372
<i>"Around 30" and "around 40"</i>
<i>are Japanese slang coined in 2006.</i>

00:11:46.455 --> 00:11:47.665
(VARIOUS THEORIES EXIST)

00:11:48.249 --> 00:11:49.708
Shoot…

00:11:49.792 --> 00:11:52.294
we don't have anything special
for your birthday.

00:11:52.378 --> 00:11:54.755
No, no. Don't worry about it.

00:11:54.839 --> 00:11:57.591
Well, then at least let me impart
these words of wisdom.

00:11:58.384 --> 00:12:00.136
It's my life's philosophy.

00:12:00.636 --> 00:12:02.346
"A pinch is a chance."

00:12:04.598 --> 00:12:06.559
When you are just about to give up,

00:12:06.642 --> 00:12:09.937
when you are in a churn
of negative external forces,

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:15.025
you might be able to turn things around
just by changing your focus.

00:12:15.109 --> 00:12:19.029
So no matter what adversity
or compromised situation you face,

00:12:19.113 --> 00:12:22.491
it's crucial that you fight
to the very end.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:29.915
That was a long explanation,
but I hope you never forget it.

00:12:29.999 --> 00:12:32.042
I'm surprised to hear you impart wisdom.

00:12:32.126 --> 00:12:33.461
Thank you so much.

00:12:33.544 --> 00:12:35.296
"A pinch is a chance," huh?

00:12:35.379 --> 00:12:38.507
Sounds deep when a YouTuber
who returned from another world says that.

00:12:38.591 --> 00:12:40.468
Flattery will get you nowhere.

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.386
But now,

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:45.347
both of you
have reached the legal drinking age.

00:12:45.931 --> 00:12:47.600
<i>Icuras elran.</i>

00:12:49.143 --> 00:12:52.313
This was the very first time
I drank alcohol.

00:12:52.938 --> 00:12:54.857
It was right after I turned 20.

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.817
-You're 20 there?
-You're 20 there?

00:12:56.901 --> 00:12:58.027
That's right.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.654
Everything I've shown you up until now
was before this image,

00:13:00.738 --> 00:13:02.490
-so I was a teenager.
-A teenager?

00:13:04.325 --> 00:13:06.994
I was so young then. I've really aged.

00:13:07.077 --> 00:13:09.330
-Yeah.
-You're right.

00:13:09.413 --> 00:13:10.956
<i>He looks exactly the same as before!</i>

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.209
<i>I can't tell how he's aged.</i>

00:13:20.799 --> 00:13:22.218
Wow, so pretty.

00:13:24.136 --> 00:13:26.347
Wow…

00:13:26.847 --> 00:13:27.973
Ms. Tsundere!

00:13:28.599 --> 00:13:30.184
I guess she was there too.

00:13:30.267 --> 00:13:33.020
I thought I remembered
seeing her the next morning.

00:13:33.103 --> 00:13:36.398
Is this pretty lady
the one your uncle transformed into?

00:13:36.482 --> 00:13:38.692
Yeah, she is his stalker.

00:13:38.776 --> 00:13:41.195
-Don't you mean the other way around?
-No. I said that right.

00:13:41.278 --> 00:13:42.947
I don't know why, but she stalked him.

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:45.741
-Are you talking about <i>Land Stalker</i>?
-Uncle, stay out of this.

00:13:49.954 --> 00:13:51.038
What a coincidence.

00:13:51.956 --> 00:13:53.999
Other tables are available--

00:13:54.083 --> 00:13:56.252
What the hell was that the other day?

00:13:56.835 --> 00:13:59.505
You resealed the barrier above the city.

00:14:01.131 --> 00:14:03.259
Where did you learn to do that?

00:14:07.054 --> 00:14:09.014
Hey, try this.

00:14:14.103 --> 00:14:16.438
What is this? It's pretty good.

00:14:17.022 --> 00:14:18.524
There are other dishes too.

00:14:18.607 --> 00:14:22.528
It'd be great if you don't tell a soul
that I broke the barrier.

00:14:22.611 --> 00:14:24.947
-What?
-Please don't tell anyone.

00:14:27.241 --> 00:14:30.369
How did you become so strong, orc face?

00:14:30.452 --> 00:14:35.541
Because I worked hard
and trained countless times… by myself.

00:14:35.624 --> 00:14:37.626
That's not what I mean.

00:14:38.669 --> 00:14:40.838
<i>Three years ago, when I first met you…</i>

00:14:54.518 --> 00:14:57.646
<i>you were obviously a novice fighter.</i>

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.149
<i>But you somehow managed to slay</i>
<i>the venom dragon.</i>

00:15:02.568 --> 00:15:05.321
<i>I didn't know that was the venom dragon.</i>

00:15:05.404 --> 00:15:07.948
Yes, it was. It was the venom dragon.

00:15:08.991 --> 00:15:12.578
Did you fight without knowing what it was?
With no weapons nor training?

00:15:12.661 --> 00:15:15.372
You'd have died in normal circumstances.
You stupid orc face--

00:15:15.456 --> 00:15:19.043
What was I supposed to do?
I just wanted to save you.

00:15:23.589 --> 00:15:27.760
Do you go around
seducing other girls like that?

00:15:28.469 --> 00:15:31.472
When I slew the blaze dragon,
the girl really appreciated me.

00:15:33.349 --> 00:15:34.350
The blaze dragon?

00:15:34.433 --> 00:15:36.435
Did you use the god-freezing sword?

00:15:36.518 --> 00:15:39.146
Were you recognized as a torchbearer
of the Ice clan?

00:15:39.229 --> 00:15:41.857
-No. I defeated it without the sword.
-You can't be serious.

00:15:42.483 --> 00:15:46.028
The legendary blaze dragon
is covered by magical blazing scales,

00:15:46.111 --> 00:15:48.614
and you can only seal it with ice.

00:15:48.697 --> 00:15:50.032
No, you are wrong.

00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:51.575
A blaze for a blaze.

00:15:51.659 --> 00:15:55.871
While the dragon is spitting fire,
a physical sword can deal some damage.

00:15:55.955 --> 00:15:58.332
What? How did you figure that out?

00:15:58.958 --> 00:16:01.585
I challenged it many times
with different strategies.

00:16:02.419 --> 00:16:04.046
You don't believe me?

00:16:05.214 --> 00:16:08.384
Here's the spoils from the battle.
It's bottled blaze.

00:16:08.467 --> 00:16:11.679
Open it, and the blaze dragon
will come back to life.

00:16:11.762 --> 00:16:13.013
Seriously?

00:16:13.097 --> 00:16:14.598
You can always kill it again.

00:16:15.099 --> 00:16:17.393
Sir Orc has nothing to fear, right?

00:16:18.102 --> 00:16:19.144
That's not true.

00:16:19.228 --> 00:16:23.107
The reason you can't beat it
is because you've given up from the start.

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:24.400
What did you say?

00:16:25.067 --> 00:16:26.527
"A pinch is a chance."

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:27.861
What?

00:16:27.945 --> 00:16:29.446
It's my motto.

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:33.993
A single move may turn the tables
even in the worst circumstances.

00:16:34.493 --> 00:16:39.164
That's why you should never give up,
and you should keep trying.

00:16:40.416 --> 00:16:43.419
Unexpectedly profound coming from you,
orc face. Who said that first?

00:16:44.545 --> 00:16:46.630
<i>Puyo Puyo</i>'s strategy guidebook.

00:16:48.173 --> 00:16:51.343
<i>When playing</i> Puyo Puyo<i>,</i>
<i>even when half the screen is gone,</i>

00:16:51.427 --> 00:16:53.303
<i>don't give up and keep building.</i>

00:16:53.387 --> 00:16:55.973
<i>You might strike a huge combo and win big.</i>

00:16:56.056 --> 00:16:59.435
<i>He learned life lessons</i>
<i>from</i> Puyo Puyo<i>'s strategy guidebook.</i>

00:17:00.102 --> 00:17:01.770
<i>I got tricked again.</i>

00:17:02.479 --> 00:17:03.939
I've got an itch to play.

00:17:04.523 --> 00:17:07.151
Do you want to play <i>Puyo Puyo Sun</i>
on the SEGA SATURN?

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:10.571
When you get tired of sitting there,
come join me.

00:17:10.654 --> 00:17:13.282
<i>Uncle is already moving on</i>
<i>to the next thing.</i>

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:16.243
<i>Are you busy after this?</i>

00:17:16.326 --> 00:17:19.329
<i>I booked a room at the inn.</i>
<i>Why don't you come with me?</i>

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:25.794
You think I'd follow you back
to your place that easily?

00:17:25.878 --> 00:17:27.588
So you've shown your true colors, orc!

00:17:34.845 --> 00:17:36.388
Don't touch me.

00:17:36.472 --> 00:17:38.098
What?

00:17:38.182 --> 00:17:39.475
Why?

00:17:39.558 --> 00:17:41.393
-Let's go.
-Okay.

00:17:41.935 --> 00:17:44.104
No, I didn't mean that.

00:17:45.314 --> 00:17:46.398
Uncle.

00:17:47.107 --> 00:17:49.443
Does he become an animal when he's drunk?

00:17:49.526 --> 00:17:51.612
Can you guys join me
for a round of <i>Puyo Puyo</i>--

00:17:51.695 --> 00:17:54.364
We're fine! Go play a single-player game
or something.

00:17:54.865 --> 00:17:56.116
Here you are.

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:57.993
It's <i>Burning Rangers</i>.

00:17:58.077 --> 00:18:00.287
It's not the same
without a multi controller.

00:18:02.289 --> 00:18:04.083
You know how to handle him.

00:18:04.166 --> 00:18:05.167
<i>Hey, you.</i>

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:08.045
W-- Walk straight.

00:18:08.128 --> 00:18:09.129
Thank you.

00:18:09.838 --> 00:18:13.759
I'm glad I have you to support me
when things are rough.

00:18:13.842 --> 00:18:15.094
What?

00:18:16.637 --> 00:18:19.056
You've been hiding your pain all along.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:21.642
To be honest, it's been rough.

00:18:22.184 --> 00:18:23.936
But I had you.

00:18:26.355 --> 00:18:27.981
The room is on the second floor.

00:18:28.857 --> 00:18:29.858
Okay.

00:18:34.404 --> 00:18:37.699
I didn't realize I meant so much to you.

00:18:38.492 --> 00:18:39.493
Here.

00:18:41.161 --> 00:18:42.496
Now, where's that key?

00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:50.295
You are such a slouch! Fine then.

00:18:50.379 --> 00:18:55.509
I guess I have no choice
but to help you this way forever.

00:18:56.009 --> 00:18:58.846
No. I'm good now.

00:19:02.141 --> 00:19:06.103
You saved me!
Being drunk is rough, all right!

00:19:06.186 --> 00:19:09.022
Thanks for helping me get back to my room.
See you later!

00:19:19.408 --> 00:19:22.661
Takafumi, this game is much harder to play
without a multi-controller.

00:19:23.537 --> 00:19:24.872
Did I fall asleep?

00:19:24.955 --> 00:19:26.039
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:19:26.123 --> 00:19:28.250
Let's skip to the following morning.

00:19:29.793 --> 00:19:31.378
<i>My head is killing me.</i>

00:19:31.461 --> 00:19:33.505
<i>Hey, orc face, you sleepyhead.</i>

00:19:33.589 --> 00:19:36.175
-<i>What are we going to do today?</i>
-<i>Why are you here?</i>

00:19:36.258 --> 00:19:39.011
<i>I'm going to try to clear</i>
<i>the death trap dungeon.</i>

00:19:39.094 --> 00:19:40.971
Talk about resilience. This girl!

00:19:41.054 --> 00:19:42.431
-Wait. Look at her eyes.
-What?

00:19:47.978 --> 00:19:50.439
Nothing noteworthy… right?

00:19:54.318 --> 00:19:57.196
-Fujimiya?
-I can't help but drink!

00:19:57.279 --> 00:19:58.572
Oh, I get it.

00:19:58.655 --> 00:20:00.324
Here. You must drink too!

00:20:00.407 --> 00:20:01.783
HEALING LEMON SOUR
ALCOHOL 5%

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.413
Uncle, you can stomach alcohol.

00:20:07.789 --> 00:20:09.833
Of course, easy-peasy--

00:20:12.794 --> 00:20:14.588
Shoot, I'm going to puke.

00:20:15.797 --> 00:20:17.174
-I'm going home.
-Wait.

00:20:17.257 --> 00:20:21.303
-You are the one who made him drunk.
-Don't worry. I'll take you home.

00:20:21.386 --> 00:20:24.056
What? No, I'm okay.
I don't live that far--

00:20:24.139 --> 00:20:25.557
Spirit of wind!

00:20:36.985 --> 00:20:39.112
I'm so dizzy!

00:20:39.196 --> 00:20:42.032
I can't fly well
without a multi controller.

00:20:42.115 --> 00:20:46.536
Takafumi! Your uncle can't tell
reality apart from video games!

00:20:46.620 --> 00:20:48.372
Uncle!

00:20:51.708 --> 00:20:54.711
<i>My uncle couldn't hold his drink at all.</i>

00:20:55.212 --> 00:20:59.424
<i>I told myself to never let him drink</i>
<i>a strong sour again.</i>

00:20:59.508 --> 00:21:03.136
Let us down, Uncle!

00:22:10.704 --> 00:22:13.081
DEATH TRAP DUNGEON

00:22:13.165 --> 00:22:15.584
Are you hurt?
I told you not to follow me in here.

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:20.505
Were you poisoned? Let me suck it out.

00:22:20.589 --> 00:22:22.924
-Leave it alone.
-How could I?

00:22:30.432 --> 00:22:32.934
You must be uncomfortable.
I'll remove your armor.

00:22:33.018 --> 00:22:34.144
What?

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:38.398
You can leave the bottom part on!

00:22:40.609 --> 00:22:42.694
Are you okay? Does it hurt?

00:22:42.778 --> 00:22:44.696
Is there anything I can do for you?

00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:47.115
Could you please leave me alone?

00:22:47.199 --> 00:22:50.702
Don't be dumb.
I can't leave you in this weakened state.

00:22:51.328 --> 00:22:53.955
Is the binding too tight
around your belly?

00:22:57.000 --> 00:22:58.126
Orc face…

00:22:58.877 --> 00:23:01.004
-Well…
-What?

00:23:01.671 --> 00:23:03.548
-Sorry.
-What?

00:23:14.935 --> 00:23:19.064
More like an aphrodisiac
in an adult manga than a poison.

00:23:19.147 --> 00:23:20.482
It actually exists.

00:23:21.066 --> 00:23:23.693
Uncle, the screen cut out.

00:23:25.028 --> 00:23:27.030
It's the effect
of the Elf's hair accessory.

00:23:27.114 --> 00:23:29.074
We can't read the memory
while it's in use.

00:23:29.658 --> 00:23:33.078
She even used an item
to hide the antidote.

00:23:33.161 --> 00:23:35.080
What a tightwad.

00:23:35.956 --> 00:23:38.750
That ought to show you the danger
of poison.

00:23:38.834 --> 00:23:41.378
Even that tough Elf almost died--

00:23:43.672 --> 00:23:46.716
I want to poison Takafumi.
Can I have a dose?

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:48.844
Why? Oh, you're so scary.

00:23:48.927 --> 00:23:50.929
Subtitle translation by:
Naoka Matsumura
